  "narration": {
    "_intro": "Welcome to this one-bedroom apartment, with open-plan living, a separate bedroom and a private balcony. Let's start at the front door.",
    "hall": "You're in the entry hall. The bathroom is straight ahead, and the bedroom door is on your right.",
    "kitchen": "The kitchen runs along one wall, with matte greige cabinetry, quartz counters, a speckled stone backsplash, and a full-size sixty-centimetre cooker.",
    "living": "The living and dining room opens up under a higher ceiling. Floor-to-ceiling glazing fills the space with daylight and frames the city view, with room for a four-seat dining table, a three-seat sofa and a lounge chair.",
    "bedroom": "The bedroom fits a queen bed with nightstands on both sides, and has its own sliding door out to the balcony.",
    "bathroom": "The bathroom is compact, with a wall-hung vanity and WC. This room wasn't photographed, so its layout is an estimate.",
    "balcony": "Step out onto the balcony for open skyline views, with space for a bistro table and two chairs."
